    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Score Focus</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Add +1 to the Difficulty Class for all saving throws called for by compositions in your favored score. This bonus stacks with the bonus from Score Focus. Additionally, you may conduct your favored score for an additional two rounds per day.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/composition-feats#toc16\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
